{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0817"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge music-stage/theatre","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/zz-r2-music-stage__theatre.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",580],["+","Many winners arrive from London: Peter Shaffer's play \"Amadeus\", about the rivalry between the court composer Antonio Salieri and the young Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart, premiered at the National Theatre in 1979, opened on Broadway in December 1980 and won the 1981 Tony Award for Best Play – five Tonys in all – before Miloš Forman filmed it. "],["=",253]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",554],["+","Viele Preisträger kommen aus London: Peter Shaffers Stück „Amadeus“ über die Rivalität zwischen dem Hofkomponisten Antonio Salieri und dem jungen Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart wurde 1979 am National Theatre uraufgeführt, kam im Dezember 1980 an den Broadway und gewann 1981 den Tony Award als bestes Stück – insgesamt fünf Tonys –, bevor Miloš Forman es verfilmte. "],["=",257]]}]},
